        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Annie Andrews",
        "text_sha256": "ea6fb8ad0db16aa8d494976e241b0d285f05e9e594395f575b00bc3f54c96754",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Annie Andrews, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "5b8e9821bbcb4f495ef78bbd60207aa3433e0b3719f6116fce72bb37a05f93a9",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "About Annie Andrews, M.D.",
        "text_sha256": "e8140e598d24833c70f95b261afc54debceac5113509ee1cfe801eb234c38431",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Annie Andrews is a board-certified pediatrician and a Clinical Professor of Pediatrics at George Washington School of Medicine.",
        "text_sha256": "c1a57520cfd7d2ba1abb0f32d32f7cc0139b9c7739cb182767527a08f54d4052",
        "word_count": 19
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Experience",
        "text_sha256": "8eab0f09df013b1bd69655991bb824cfa822d383b482905789153d4df8bfda78",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Andrews has a B.S. degree in pre-medicine from the University of Dayton. She earned her M.D. from University of Cincinnati College of Medicine and completed her residency in pediatrics at Cincinnati Children's Hospital.",
        "text_sha256": "60513e1b4b26834661139a9ab58becc5f59cb95512d44f1c17e50bb696097bf7",
        "word_count": 34
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Board certifications",
        "text_sha256": "b6ebfd0050d34a00e27b7a07eb958e6520d9d8c003bea281b96762ad17883d6b",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Andrews is board-certified by the American Board of Pediatrics.",
        "text_sha256": "47ee4b814a538edefca404971b65784563b69c6101872aa86d22c38e52fcf425",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Hospital affiliations",
        "text_sha256": "e6504e68d7e8e6b8187bc1b13e33b31f751fb7b365b27cf9f90691053f642ba2",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Andrews is affiliated with Children's National Medical Center in Washington, D.C..",
        "text_sha256": "4fb122d0effee6105a63e21ee01f71b8ba46504dc86b8816d79a69032bed746d",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Other relevant positions",
        "text_sha256": "3cb35bf4b505f1c9652a309bbf062b6c5ebff2ba01239bd968b9ac137f401f2b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Andrews is a faculty member at George Washington School of Medicine and a fellow of the American Academy of Pediatrics (FAAP). She is a Senior Advisor at Everytown for Gun Safety and Moms Demand Action. She is the Founder and CEO of Their Future. Our Vote. and Their Future PAC.",
        "text_sha256": "6cce26a54614f9e22eda8b0633fe0bed31da178d531b5b9226a34f37111d583b",
        "word_count": 51
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Publications",
        "text_sha256": "82b2eb07aaea1da81684fdbaf171f0ef11c109a086a1040e84851d67ad01856e",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Andrews has published nearly 100 peer-reviewed publications in medical journals ranging in focus from asthma to pediatric firearm injuries.",
        "text_sha256": "42bbbfc502ca6c3cdcbce00e14f8d5ab81fb0682543b9654802d0e397a93c1ce",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Awards",
        "text_sha256": "669a46138d69d7c12f52f82ccde4385630ece1947fc7e3a382b371d4aed02f28",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Andrews has received multiple awards from the AAP and the American Medical Association for her work in child advocacy.",
        "text_sha256": "a48fbae6bc0e8bbdc74da27a6216dbf8343bbb86f62da5d8d8b8820da1a56c9d",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Opens a new window",
        "text_sha256": "52b71e1a64c4aa4703a246e34de17b242088e4863ab032b365c12e07d7964633",
        "word_count": 4
      }
    ],
